            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Boo22Babes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I scaled this for only a few who will eat cranberry sauce - it was fabulous. Thank you for a keeper that is easier and tastier than the original. Great recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2025-11-27T16:01:44.211Z"
          },
          {
